# Lint after code changes

After changing Python code, run both linters from the project root:

```bash
uv run ruff check .
uv run ty check
```

Fix every diagnostic they report, then run both commands again. Repeat until both finish with no diagnostics. Do not turn rules off or add ignore comments to get a clean run. Change the linter configuration only when the user asks for that.
